# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# Runtime-only IPC/control endpoints are not archival experiment data and can
# block DVC scans when opened as ordinary files.
**/runtime/agent/*/ctl/**
**/runtime/agent-snapshot/*/ctl/**
**/runtime/pid/**
